 "remarks": "Styling Modern 1Bedroom/1BA/Wash-Dry At 127 Greyrock, The Biltmore, In The Heart Of Downtown. Chic 24/7 Concierge High-Rise with 1 Level Living. Meticulously RENOVATED Condo #1206. High floor Has Lovely Eastern Water views and courtyard Park below. Extensive Updates! All Rooms with Wood Floors, Renovated Kitchen - Cabinets, Counters And Stainless Appliances. Beautifully Renovated Bath with Rare WASHER/DRYER in Unit. Sophisticated Designer Paint, Recessed Lighting thru out. Special Film on Windows to protect furniture from sunlight. More HIGH-VALUE Perks include new HVAC 2020, Hot Water Heater(2022), and Current ASSESSMENT PAID-In-FULL! Biltmore boast large Fitness Center, Lounge, and access to 4th flr Park. RENT Parking from Propark Garage $118+/Month/Car. Rentals Allowed. Move-In Ready! Located Across From Stamford Town Center - Pickle Ball, Restaurants, NY Comedy, Place Theater, Entertainment and more - Great Location! Schedule Your Private Tour Today!",
